      "text": "Kelly Oubre Jr. with the game-winning block on Ajay Mitchell against the backboard, in addition to his first 20-point game as a Pacer. The 125-120 win ends a four-game losing streak. Siakam had 20, Toppin 17-6-4, and 16/10 from Slawson. They were +6 from deep. Next: Fri. v PHL",
